category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libarpack-devel liblapack-devel libsuperlu-devel
sdesc: "C++ linear algebra library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Armadillo is a C++ linear algebra library (matrix maths) aiming towards a
good balance between speed and ease of use. Integer, floating point and
complex numbers are supported, as well as a subset of trigonometric and
statistics functions."
skip:

homepage: https://sourceforge.net/projects/arma/
license: Apache-2.0
